    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit, my name is Linda. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 202,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767815352266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, I need to return my VeloBand Cadence Sensor. I got it for Christmas and it's just not reading my heart rate correctly.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 81435,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767815357399999
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear there's an issue with it. I can definitely help you with a return.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 202,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767815365733332
    },
    {
      "text": "So you can process that for me? Great.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 81435,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767815371799998
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, of course. Our policy allows for returns within 90 days of delivery, so it's no problem at all.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 202,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767815374533331
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, 90 days? That's great. I was a little worried I'd waited too long. What do I need to do?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 81435,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767815381399997
    },
    {
