      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 202,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767815387733330
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, I have everything.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 81435,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767815396199996
    },
    {
      "text": "Perfect. Just print that label, stick it on the box, and drop it off with the carrier. Once we receive the item back at our warehouse, your refund will be processed.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 202,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767815397933329
    },
    {
